#: scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0c402c4a6e70dfa2cc08c07bfeacd7ae0969571470c765db2b3d5fdff41da7
#. default-sha256: 7a3016bfeb7354d54b0192878fef9484d032e0e7f31edd37b0c9053450163ef0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“The mansion sat in ruins in that era; not a soul resided "
"within.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“A mansão estava em ruínas naquela época; nem uma alma "
"residia dentro.”"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc1aaca802a662a327ae056d29bf455c2df09aad567f770cf1379ac8dc499e7e
#. default-sha256: e30aee9fb201bc247d37fa941696c504f652a82b666a1d32a275e31a0cc15a39
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The grandeur of the house was lost to the ages. It was in perpetual decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A grandeza da casa foi perdida ao longo dos tempos. Estava em perpétuo declínio."

#: scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 026477443970a0cbccb612ef459f6dd6213112c0b6f3fda75e78a4704ea72066
#. default-sha256: ad9296bf9f21996ed7d709beef62ea63dd6334064d799ae68058594af7c2b92b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not a flower grew in the garden; dust and dirt blackened the plaster; cobwebs blanketed the "
"corridors; ivy shrouded the outer walls. It was not a pleasant sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nem uma flor crescia no jardim; poeira e sujeira enegreciam o gesso; teias de aranha cobriam "
"os corredores; hera cobria as paredes externas. Não era uma visão agradável."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fde72c69b9988251906ac0d5c47b3954ec8aa0da6e9bb3ff3c1f82621e6c0fcb
#. default-sha256: ce9150d265bf7f01cd017b453d298c8411dc83a1c90172ee276eda36e9a54b01
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As hard as I tried to fight it, I could not stop the mansion’s descent into disrepair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por mais que eu tentasse lutar contra isso, não consegui impedir a mansão de cair em ruínas."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 407a5606c8a8e060e0c36585839d22496c38ce66414a783a15cac4e399faaf09
#. default-sha256: 88db5fdcd6b7160d9f1b5d8c4b52ccb9124a5d1045e3585423ec305cf583bace
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The depth of the previous owner’s grief—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps despair—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was far too "
"much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A profundidade da dor do dono anterior—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ou talvez desespero—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫foi demais."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28f145c7fb8a41004c9f6486979f1a3bce5280970f33049a310542cb6ca87924
#. default-sha256: d055990b3a81e8ee3467026f4e494413e5909d0867d18328575d591f1fa81135
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After the beautiful, flaxen-haired family, people stayed away from the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Depois da linda família de cabelos de linho, as pessoas ficaram longe da mansão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4acbebaf24914dedf1a632e9b68317ebe43493c4df4df1663ab88d6af099b168
#. default-sha256: b970fe0b1ad8566a4526d446280c5ef1ee069402b1a3b8498bdb9551efc49149
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had no heirs, so their bloodline simply vanished into the depths of history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles não tinham herdeiros, então sua linhagem simplesmente desapareceu nas profundezas da "
"história."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b0ea64efaccc9f97de30a61f20b0c518e99326353aa54f534a3649dd9dbbbad
#. default-sha256: e8dfdd2405d53f36f640394c5fe0f13d8a7ff8adeb707d2aa75f62c952e6a22d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had been about fifty years since the house last had a resident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fazia cerca de cinquenta anos desde a última vez que a casa tivera um morador."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89f6e03dce60e00f3ddeb3166754b56578e07ea581d6a7930195e4305ffd38b1
#. default-sha256: fa3130af0f38922fc42b9bfb893fc6b0a75f0e8f87aca4cff155e37c06dd8e1c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The forlorn property appeared as though it had been abandoned for centuries, and the "
"occasional villager who stumbled upon it did not remain there for more than a day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A propriedade isolada parecia ter sido abandonada por séculos, e se um aldeão se deparava "
"com ela, não permanecia ali por mais de um dia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b1df54b9701f5f9dc42a85184b78ecd8de7b2ac23080c030d533f0966c874e7
#. default-sha256: 0da2577d75243bca72f019b56602bafeb82272ade1f9813246b6057eb752add7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My time there was rather solitary. ⟪k:1⟫That was perhaps the loneliest time of my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Esse tempo foi bastante solitário. ⟪k:1⟫ Essa foi talvez a época mais solitária da minha "
"vida."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 847cc4ed8923cc3f972168c75b2ded6ce55032468277f32030d9a87bf7e4495c
#. default-sha256: 0ecbc7514d3a80306c94549951b778b2216667d3d023a74bf9dc814deb3c8e06
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Everyone who visited the mansion feared it, and it was left without anyone to become its "
"master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Todos os que visitavam a mansão a temiam, e ela foi deixada sem ninguém para tornar-se seu "
"mestre."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c68efc6cbab99bbd8b0f5cfcf5b233890cf19b901338989cae8f1128852d1d2e
#. default-sha256: 480cb085be292d1d3430f68037dfa15f3bfed48a09edf54f690641928adb0848
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even came to believe that my time serving as a maid would come to an end in this era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cheguei até a acreditar que meu tempo servindo como criada chegaria ao fim nessa época."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 859558ac9f9b93ed94bfd028848b40c9dfff47e0da2e898df12edad0a54484f7
#. default-sha256: babd67854f7c4c8faffa60669d8ca965534aecab3ba6b2021af7ceb67b7b2db3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, one day, I noticed something out of the ordinary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No entanto, um dia, notei algo fora do comum."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17e09a6a27a4c76d6528f7cc72975c93af9f513dee5c6e790e5580152e3a53d1
#. default-sha256: f179ef31f68cf8db8a54ce2f2a5b899464563e80e4e9fb3ec297f8b3101fe833
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a servant of the house, I am almost immediately aware of any new presence within its "
"walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como uma serva da casa, eu quase imediatamente ficava ciente de qualquer nova presença "
"dentro de suas paredes."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db0e03059a6cbd8ef1015672e85cb5ebbc5cb74eebb13c439b9ac342accce861
#. default-sha256: 1e66227afe9463dd01b136e2ccb111fb6031bdda3c50119b08cc2141dd069dbf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there appeared to be someone downstairs."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E parecia haver alguém lá embaixo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 312e580f05adbff8462e3d280441cafdc6e1b6703f1d7483e372f479d778a235
#. default-sha256: 581d5e8e47226dee5b1978a96767181c6a655540d9e4ee87e53c87ba78af1914
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Can you imagine just how delighted I was?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você pode imaginar o quão feliz eu estava?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90d81e20bdd9a8435ab15245036f429b7793a32869a25aa1896ee31f8f9f7ab8
#. default-sha256: 92bec2cd2000a5bbef1fc31df9aaced94180b7e6ec77441040f29aaeb90e5745
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though part of me was anxious about what kind of person I might find, the "
"possibility that it could be you had my heart aflutter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Embora parte de mim estivesse ansiosa quanto a que tipo de pessoa eu poderia "
"encontrar, a possibilidade de que pudesse ser você fez meu coração palpitar."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 654b4e6544b1628cf18e235ba2b82e44c3014c1b4b233077d20afc8468db11e5
#. default-sha256: f5806b607c39c40f23fd9662003ac2c1339d6483c3dc6aa4c5f2fe6e741a91da
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, resisting the urge to rush, I headed for the basement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então, resistindo ao impulso de correr, fui para o porão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bafdd9369cd79767d543fe69ea3cff2e8db24b85f45d1f73c20e7f60efd7e78
#. default-sha256: d40cd84082916ccb91a5d8ad95fc0c65e21b484da9f29e02298736e89bfa316c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where red wine, smoked meat, and other preserved foods were kept."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A adega era onde se guardavam vinho tinto, carne defumada e outros alimentos em conserva."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfbfc1529005124e91bafc3d32828b0d88a0d294d2a4863e3a2063a759144cbe
#. default-sha256: 06ab249b4d3e891ab514b1e66efd2909e6302eb8fa464735bb60060c71a135d5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By that point, the wine was practically antique."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A essa altura, o vinho já era praticamente antiguidade."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9a2cf7507a82ac1a9897f7d8f6ba78330c671e3d72ece5477a8fc81d3cacde7
#. default-sha256: 3204c7c39e8fbac72a486e7006859b4d44b7adfe838fc23fdb7e7922161e301b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I had expected, a man had made his way into the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Como eu esperava, um homem entrou no porão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 091d7dc2a33b9b1a405f2a1b235bf97de14f7e9b1b52d55684b7ceb4a9fca074
#. default-sha256: d3a3e599e92389c9feb9f2992d68052f9bbfc0ad91aca21386e20d54e6c8688b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Is anyone there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tem alguém aí?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8555e57d373d86c1ce1e9bfe675e6aa8d658f2f8ee5494817f4387b750a9c157
#. default-sha256: c3726ff1c3d09ab19f388b033a9f5744a68da13e2134ce08d49a35308fb90464
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although, I am unsure if referring to him as a “man” is entirely accurate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Embora eu não tenha certeza se me referir a ele como um “homem” é totalmente correto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A93706E_89F4_4CA8_9521_8C4E07974C4C
