msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The odor emanated from the man, heightened by the food he had carelessly rummaged through."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O odor emanava do homem, intensificado pela comida que ele remexia descuidadamente."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C1CF5EED_D967_46E3_BAEA_7D481DC2FF5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7844610e56c2049858903590149211ad71f93c78e2f50e3fd0e708809961f93c
