msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C1CF5EED_D967_46E3_BAEA_7D481DC2FF5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Blood-red liquid spilled from wine barrels, soaking the floor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Líquido vermelho-sangue derramou de barris de vinho, encharcando o chão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4791847B_28A8_437F_8D8C_3EDEA8044954
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66dcfb7eeebab01cdf213c17c36d23344c1dd987eac7c832c436c3437cede1cf
#. default-sha256: 5cd6a7d7da41c41c57e3ba6f25dc04a397b061b8db0aa9944cff1bd9f6096fb9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4791847B_28A8_437F_8D8C_3EDEA8044954"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His sunken eyes had a piercing, wolf-like glimmer in them. His teeth were sharp and "
"yellowed, visible as he ripped into a chunk of meat. He grumbled in a seemingly inhuman tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seus olhos fundos tinham um brilho penetrante de lobo. Seus dentes eram amarelados e "
"afiados, visíveis enquanto ele rasgava um pedaço de carne. Ele resmungou em uma língua "
"aparentemente inumana."

#: scenario2:scenario2_787445AC_69E8_4BEF_85E0_8BF1246C9160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba08d9e9cba815fde84a20c4a451d9bbca5444f90a9b33c56e7496df72edd59b
#. default-sha256: 9ef6d1e5486d6fb7149cab5afae957e9cacd2c8dc4d1de9160379f3a1372295a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_787445AC_69E8_4BEF_85E0_8BF1246C9160"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was looking at a beast. ⟪k:1⟫Or perhaps a half-beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu estava olhando para uma fera. ⟪k:1⟫Ou talvez uma meio-fera."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE2EB011_CDA1_42B1_A23F_F07DB21EC612
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8dbef01b82df98f1d2fee123deb791c52e0509a96f2eff101216ed77590ed6b
