msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE2EB011_CDA1_42B1_A23F_F07DB21EC612"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was another source of odor in the room, though. ⟪k:1⟫It had something of a kind of "
"metallic tinge to it, and when I noticed this..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia outra fonte de odor no aposento, no entanto. ⟪k:1⟫ Tinha uma espécie de tom metálico, "
"e quando notei..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_86319B00_68D9_4163_A412_19DCA6EF73B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3afa4a939ce000e8c291270cf3dad6b8993e08d3b2572ade7e1d3af4b9fd289d
#. default-sha256: 7c8dad96426e09d1390b37329d4409586037373b1fee8cdddbf8f8721047ceda
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86319B00_68D9_4163_A412_19DCA6EF73B0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I nearly passed out. ⟪k:1⟫The red liquid was not just wine, as I had assumed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu quase desmaiei. ⟪k:1⟫O líquido vermelho não era apenas vinho, como eu havia presumido."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3C60F28_EB03_4988_99D9_441C3CFBB376
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38ab58e8203d7edf0ab70340647c25c4ee9125237789c28a3373a54e446c93d2
#. default-sha256: 354ec9ca3d9442245ff96a4215859aa80f414b5e55fe3def70aa98c9d7eccb56
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3C60F28_EB03_4988_99D9_441C3CFBB376"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast had, I presume, stolen a weapon from the village. ⟪k:1⟫A sword far too nice for "
"him lay on the floor by his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A fera tinha, eu presumo, roubado uma arma da aldeia. ⟪k:1⟫ Uma espada boa demais para ele "
"estava no chão ao seu lado."

#: scenario2:scenario2_38461A89_9CBA_4005_AD1F_4233F9E2576D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd4b403250e10d223d89d36aff5b6faaa9f922a1bccab731fe39296668c00cfc
#. default-sha256: 3fb7cc7c790359ae5b2c6efaeb1c0f22094ac6da59d54e1021599c864ec2c3ef
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_38461A89_9CBA_4005_AD1F_4233F9E2576D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could hardly imagine how many people’s lives he had taken with that blade. ⟪k:1⟫It was "
"visibly wet with blood, even in the darkness of the cellar. But at the same time, it had an "
"imposing gleam."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu mal podia imaginar quantas vidas ele havia tirado com aquela lâmina. ⟪k:1⟫ Estava "
"visivelmente molhada de sangue, mesmo na escuridão do porão. Mas, ao mesmo tempo, tinha um brilho "
"imponente."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF164A91_D207_49DC_8E9D_0D0B1BD3C129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9aa484d030d2d3a631b6a4a03faf14eb912ff7d3760f1a5584ed90962f7cb06c
