msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF164A91_D207_49DC_8E9D_0D0B1BD3C129"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fine, luscious aroma of the wine could not mask the stench of blood and the beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O aroma fino e delicioso do vinho não conseguia mascarar o fedor do sangue e da fera."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5F608901_79E3_4B7E_BD17_37AEED323F52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f389352db9e98cafcb0171372b383287bb77df82490efa902e8d36443a2d770
