msgid "⟪k:0⟫Holding my breath, I took a few moments to ponder."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Prendendo a respiração, passei alguns momentos ponderando."

#: scenario2:scenario2_83074F67_A2B5_4144_B7B8_320B30871810
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f23fd8a0bd8ca92bcce0fd8453f452799144498f8319811dd79b213d4f609b
