msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The wolf was able to fool the innocent little girl simply by putting on clothing, after "
"all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Afinal, simplesmente colocando roupas, o lobo conseguiu enganar a inocente garotinha."

