msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh dear, I was afraid you wouldn’t understand me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What am I to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, nossa, eu estava com medo de que você não me entendesse.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫O que eu devo "
"fazer?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_47547A2F_83BE_4437_861A_9135AF6DFC45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2a425596b9be5dbe9f7d5b6ab1c46c1d0b0a332a6376c1973cdfd68309250fd
