msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9BDF0362_1EAE_4AA9_B4BF_FC6AADF9D3D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, it meant a great deal to me then that I had found someone who did not fear the "
"mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫be they human or beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Todavia, para mim, era muito importante ter encontrado alguém que não temia a mansão...⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫seja ele humano ou fera."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9DE01657_F670_4BDB_9C2B_AD22BF342A8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11c8b28f36a4746cb199e1c104c1344bd133d65091abf2df6487913e4ef08474
